  "body": "Sunshine, sea views and Manly beach just 250 metres away - this is the kind of home that effortlessly ties spontaneous swims, salty hair and slow summer evenings into everyday life. Your own dreamy slice of coastal living in Whangaparaoa! Meticulously renovated and bathed in natural light, this elevated Beach Road beauty delivers three generous bedrooms, a brand new kitchen, new bathroom and inviting living spaces that spill out to the large new deck with north-facing sea views. With Manly Beach at one end of the road and the cafes and shops of Manly Village at the other, you're perfectly placed to enjoy the best of coastal living.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Elevated position with north-facing sea views\r\n* Just 250m stroll to the beach\r\n* Dreamy renovation with a brand-new kitchen\r\n* Newly renovated bathroom\r\n* Private patio off the kitchen and dining\r\n* Light-filled living flowing onto a large, brand-new deck\r\n* Three generously sized bedrooms\r\n* Durable Lockwood-style interior\r\n* Carport and garden shed for everyday convenience\r\n* Walking distance to Manly Bowling Club and Manly Park\r\n* Excellent schooling options including Whangaparaoa Primary & Whangaparaoa College\r\n\r\nManly is all about the coastal lifestyle, and here you're perfectly placed to make the most of it. Spend your mornings swimming or strolling the shoreline, grab a coffee from the village cafes, or head out on the water with the local sailing club. With vibrant shops, restaurants, Manly Bowling Club and a welcoming community all close by, everything you love about beachside living is right here.\r\n\r\nAnd with the Penlink connection under construction, making the Hibiscus Coast even more accessible is firmly on the horizon. It's an exciting time to secure your place in this sought-after coastal community. Whether you're searching for a beautifully renovated first home, a beachside retreat or simply a more relaxed way of life, this Beach Road beauty is one to put at the top of your list.\r\n\r\nCome discover the magic of Manly living for yourself.\r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thursday 26th November (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/FUAV\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
